runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-05/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "according to local legend a giant carrying clay to fill a narrow ford lost it on the way, making the mound [S4]; the Dobberworth is near Sagard [S1]; it is about 15 metres tall [S2]; it is the largest tumulus on Ruegen [S2]"}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-05: verifier teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-05-verify-002 (verify), VERIFIED", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-05/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "The Dobberworth is a prehistoric tumulus (burial mound) on Rügen near Sagard [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dobberworth]; The Dobberworth is about 15 metres tall [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dobberworth]; The Dobberworth is the largest tumulus on Rügen [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dobberworth]; Local legend says a giant, meaning to fill a narrow ford, lost the clay he was carrying on the way, and the mound is what fell [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dobberworth]; The mound stands at the southern edge of Sagard on Rügen (German Wikipedia: a Hügelgrab, one of the largest in northern Germany) [SUPPORTED: https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dobberworth]"}]'::jsonb),
