a were found [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Temple_of_Athena_(Paestum)]; Doric and Ionic orders share one building (the temple combines both orders) [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Temple_of_Athena_(Paestum)]"}]'::jsonb),
